{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:00 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥老婆任祉妍性感泳裝晒白滑長腿  視帝充當御用攝影師放閃  子女遺傳高顏值基因\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d293fed034142237120e6c5f6a93778c/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_175.png\"/>\n<p>視帝譚俊彥近日與太太任祉妍帶同一對子女，飛往度假勝地越南富國島，享受陽光與海灘的悠閒時光。任祉妍日前在社交平台上載了一輯旅遊花絮照大送福利。相中所見，任祉妍身穿黑色露背一件頭泳衣，戴上太陽眼鏡及草帽在沙灘椅上大展甜美笑容，皮膚白滑細緻，保養得宜；而譚俊彥亦赤裸上身大騷陽光健碩身形，與太太緊貼依偎同框放閃，甜蜜氣氛爆燈，羨煞旁人。</p>\n<h2>譚俊彥「老公視角」捕捉白滑長腿</h2>\n<p>除了溫馨的夫妻合照外，譚俊彥更充當太太的「御用攝影師」，親自操刀拍攝多張唯美靚相。不論是任祉妍在沙灘吊床上閉目養神的慵懶姿態，抑或穿上高衩長裙漫步林蔭大道、大騷白皙逆天長腿，在老公的鏡頭下都顯得格外動人。此外，任祉妍手持長弓在夕陽餘暉下的沙灘剪影，完美線條更凸顯出修長身段，足見譚俊彥的拍攝技術達專業級數，鏡頭內外盡是滿滿愛意。</p>\n<img alt=\"視帝譚俊彥46歲生日，一家四口溫馨滿瀉，太太任祉妍與一對仔女送上蛋糕，幸福洋溢\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48f57239966930fb1073955ee3915de4/2026-07/3952752195052495046_223548469.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"著名影星狄龍是譚俊彥的父親，現已三代同堂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef0064f3e12b92b2a019ebb2345ba2a4/2023-06/2018_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥與任祉妍2017年添囝囝Rex。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba06d4efd71d638b8e0f16155153ad49/2023-06/2017_8_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"爺爺狄龍對兩個孫非常愛錫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7df7f15a8f076b2bc53b8f82ec114c6/2023-06/2018_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近日譚俊彥一家四口到富國島旅行，太太任祉妍甜蜜依偎在老公肩頭，夫妻同框放閃令人羨慕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/425f4a68c59eacb16f0f6c820e272a54/2026-10/SaveClip_App_863353191_18641494816060470_7057952285784981217_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍編上雙辮子、戴上太陽眼鏡，對著鏡頭甜笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0195b928c22a2fef103a57cc408fb366/2026-10/SaveClip_App_864825556_18641494870060470_7712580974933732813_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥與任祉妍的一對寶貝仔女在泳池邊貼頭合照，甜笑模樣完美遺傳了父母的優良基因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f62d00f04ad3ef1c01d7293eda68d412/2026-10/SaveClip_App_857459262_18640455175060470_6292361502837792472_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍穿上黑色大露背泳衣在椰林大道漫步，在老公譚俊彥的鏡頭下，展現唯美浪漫的身姿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0375851ffdf59dca984def75af0a83ac/2026-10/SaveClip_App_858050024_18640455133060470_4869925347920660500_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍背著編織袋回眸大展甜美笑容，不論氣質還是白滑美肌都被老公譚俊彥捕捉得極致動人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1116336766bdf4802f627d2b0b9b985/2026-10/SaveClip_App_858702261_18640455205060470_3447867548859917438_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍在富國島夕陽下的沙灘吊床上閉目養神，展現美好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14defd9c66c0852f0c062bd9ce066568/2026-10/SaveClip_App_859857092_18640455184060470_4439225864214884674_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥與任祉妍分別牽著一對寶貝仔女漫步於綠意盎然的度假村中，一家四口的背影寫滿了治癒與溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6d9ca4373abc8593e02aa6a026990147/2026-10/SaveClip_App_861230789_18640455145060470_8741873604620811790_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍身穿一件頭黑色泳衣配草帽，在沙灘椅上展露招牌白滑美肌與甜笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffc281c95a8f159bf947681bbd7c7520/2026-10/SaveClip_App_863381776_18641494768060470_1733475311632528445_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥與任祉妍貼背依偎，在陽光下展現幸福夫妻相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd66a36d881711f1a5c6357471ad13cb/2026-10/SaveClip_App_863879915_18641494936060470_2507386107140358789_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍穿上黃色高開衩長裙秀出白滑逆天長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f1f09c01bb8a45b546cd68568679651/2026-10/SaveClip_App_863953863_18641494777060470_8223825395068610398_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍在富國島的夕陽下擺出英氣十足的射箭姿勢，大晒凹凸有致的完美線條。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc4be0ce14cacdb2ffe8effec703aa87/2026-10/SaveClip_App_864758334_18641494996060470_2467443232494477008_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥戴著墨鏡、赤裸上身倚在椰林樹旁大展結實肌肉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ca716b46e8994d6ff06b7cd840541c7/2026-10/SaveClip_App_866185932_18641494801060470_8443278145006191401_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"任祉妍在林蔭大道上低頭優雅漫步，開衩裙襬微露美腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bcf22814ca3fafffc4936000db3470ff/2026-10/SaveClip_App_868152447_18641494966060470_4705144231822452307_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前Rex迎來9歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a6ea6dfb8862fe5e675aea463037d56/2026-08/yannlovepeace_1787671328_3971592190932315821_223548469.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥老婆任祉妍分享子女合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35c4db2d2c435c7ad4d46ec9bdcd1d09/2026-08/yannlovepeace_1787671328_3971592192803207545_223548469.jpg\"/>\n<h2>譚俊彥子女遺傳優良基因</h2>\n<p>除了夫妻倆甜蜜放閃，同行的一對寶貝仔女亦相當吸睛，一家四口溫馨滿瀉。從相片中可見，小朋友完美遺傳了父母的優良基因，大女五官標緻，笑容甜美；細仔則活潑精靈。兩姊弟在泳池邊貼頭合照，對著鏡頭展現燦爛無邪的模樣，可愛度爆燈。一家人更在黃昏時分於海水中嬉戲，畫面治癒溫馨，引來大批網民紛紛留言，大讚譚俊彥一家顏值極高，生活幸福美滿。</p>\n<img alt=\"狄龍早前獲家人慶祝80歲大壽，孫仔譚杺極似爺爺，全程窩心黐實。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b58fb81b13df3cd9e72be7b41a9b595b/2026-08/1_12_29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄龍獲一對孫仔孫女錫錫慶祝80歲大壽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/949b38dd034eac8f5a48070fd4f2340c/2026-08/2_4_28.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥太太任祉妍早前生日，與老公譚俊彥、老爺狄龍、奶奶陶敏明以及一對仔女三代同堂，溫馨大合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35ebc09315835ee91e6bdb4098d5bdb8/2026-09/SaveClip_App_820064561_18630207520060470_8620429206639176501_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星女任祉妍狀態大勇，鏡頭前散發幸福光芒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fff62d9d6d656cc0e8de4bb762e20f39/2026-09/SaveClip_App_817191715_18630207469060470_7917593218579238955_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥囝囝越大越靚仔，完美遺傳爸爸的優良基因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d15e75a76c5998ca091d4e44bf7a2b79/2026-09/SaveClip_App_818062652_18630207841060470_2977602912015921222_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"簡單一句「Happy Birthday Honey」，盡顯譚俊彥對太太的愛意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49926737cd6bacc0ce1e8d856e609aee/2026-09/SaveClip_App_818122859_18630207832060470_5715276723962306866_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"獲一對寶貝仔女左右夾攻送上「愛的獻吻」，任祉妍冧到甜笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d625002f2066b18c0cfa8e49de43113e/2026-09/SaveClip_App_818902406_18630207499060470_3704195294409256151_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"囝囝攬實媽咪影合照，母子情深，場面溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cc0fc969acc9087a8a3c91545c49136/2026-09/SaveClip_App_819354391_18630207511060470_6361010083353527500_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「你是我整個世界！」收到子女親手寫的心意卡，相信是任祉妍收到最窩心的生日禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fa6d1305c99d0f36740aa1006f29b78/2026-09/SaveClip_App_819470251_18630207889060470_4121928761489754425_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女兒從後擁抱媽咪，兩母女餅印一樣，顏值超高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20848f8cfb53c459025cb091b2144eca/2026-09/SaveClip_App_820147403_18630207490060470_5988850597625700392_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥女兒樣子甜美，對鏡頭單手托腮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b83721626266eacd856c48b6af6a497f/2026-09/SaveClip_App_820239400_18630207850060470_1277521173729524006_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Rex調皮地輕咬剛到手的空手道全港冠軍金牌，英氣十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c376cb9d8d249a5a62584f77599e472a/2026-09/SaveClip_App_798392784_18624271534060470_7940137190250391578_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"媽媽任祉妍親自到場為愛子打氣，見證Rex經歷兩年多刻苦練習後成功奪冠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a36a00093457b96aaf61c3b3665e4ba/2026-09/SaveClip_App_798884260_18624271558060470_4979631449163287790_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥9歲兒子譚杺勇奪全港空手道比賽金牌，站在冠軍領獎台後，與教練開心合照留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f91a396edd294138c88a5f147c3fd82d/2026-09/SaveClip_App_798392781_18624271549060470_7967987985501612618_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄龍與陶敏明1975年結婚，80年誕下譚俊彥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/36dedf7786fd439ae89c1ea5ca7e94b9/2024-06/dscn8354_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陶敏明和狄龍已結婚50年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3065169a96530587843245f5899487fb/2024-06/d5110d22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"譚俊彥兩歲時的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b42a5ee2b02a35e52ada65b73eac321/2023-06/156_bpa_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄龍和家人一齊慶祝79歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a89aa109322f6d552ccbdc230c518f1/2025-08/52_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄龍一直手持一張代表邵氏兄弟的咭紙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c10364ccc068957e10919f5ed88bdbf4/2025-08/54_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄龍孫仔譚杺越來越靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0679dca7420f88ccd30906ab420cd268/2025-08/56_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄龍有家人陪伴喜形於色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d913e2ceb0d16b4c8c3cd42f259582f/2025-08/57_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"狄龍是一代大俠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a49b18664d6c01349b9b2bc93607d584/2024-06/enp20p10080603.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:52.522145+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":547,"images":42,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:58:53.829852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:49.436135+00:00","content_hash":"732e5b6e0b8d2f80f7bbadd10be8cfe90fe945868ee8edb8cb9974fd27daade1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}